Subject: [PATCH] Allow queue-thread execution with asynchronous shared locks

With --thread-pool-size=0, dispatch ordinary requests on the queue thread.
Keep SETLKW and INTERRUPT on the existing retry queue and preserve profiling.
The default worker count is unchanged.

